<html>
<head>
    <style>
        @page Section1 {
            size: 8.5in 11.0in;
            margin: 1.0in 1.0in 1.0in 1.0in;
            mso-header-margin: .5in;
            mso-footer-margin: .5in;
            mso-title-page: yes;
            mso-header: h1;
            mso-footer: f1;
            mso-break-type: section-break;
        }

        div.Section1 {
            page: Section1;
        }

        table#hrdftrtbl {
            margin: 0in 0in 0in 900in;
            width: 1px;
            height: 1px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        pageBreak {
            clear: all;
            page-break-before: always;
            mso-special-character: line-break;
        }

        @page Section2 {
            size: 8.5in 11.0in;
            margin: 1.0in 1.0in 1.0in 1.0in;
            mso-header-margin: .5in;
            mso-footer-margin: .5in;
            mso-title-page: yes;
            mso-header: fh1;
            mso-footer: ff1;
            mso-break-type: section-break;
        }

        div.Section2 {
            page: Section2;
        }

        table#tblforheader {
            margin: 0in 0in 0in 900in;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        pageBreak2 {
            clear: all;
            page-break-before: always;
            mso-special-character: line-break;
        }

        @media print {
            thead {
                display: table-header-group;
            }

            .break {
                page-break-after: always;
            }
        }

        td, div {
            font-family: Arial;
            font-size: 10pt;
            padding: 0;
        }

        td {
            padding: 0;
        }

        .table2 {
            border-collapse: collapse;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .table2 th, .table2 td {
            border: 1px solid black;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #DEDEDE;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <table border="1" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-weight: normal;">
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>
                    <table width="100%">
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td width="20%">
                                    <img width="120" height="100" src="$imgUrl"/>
                                </td>
                                <td>
                                    <table>
                                        <tbody>
                                            <tr><td><strong>$ptjName</strong></td></tr>
                                            <tr><td><strong>$ministryJabatanName</strong></td></tr>
                                            <tr><td><strong>$ptjAddress</strong></td></tr>
                                            <tr><td><strong>Tel No: $telNo</strong></td></tr>
                                            <tr><td><strong>Fax No: $faxNo</strong></td></tr>
                                        </tbody>
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
    <br/>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: center;">
        <strong><u>NOTIS PENAMATAN BERSAMA</u></strong>
    </div>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: right;">Rujukan: $fileRefNo</div>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: right;">Tarikh: $noticeDate</div>
    <br/>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: left;">Kepada:&nbsp;</div>
    <div style="text-align: left;">
        <strong>$supplierName</strong>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: left;">
        <strong>$supplierAddress</strong>
    </div>
    <br/>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: left;">Tuan,</div>
    <table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <div>
                    <table>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td><p><strong>Notis Penamatan Bersama Bagi </strong></p></td>
                                <td><p><strong>:</strong></p></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><p><strong>Kontrak </strong></p></td>
                                <td><p>: $contractTitle</p></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><p><strong>No. Kontrak </strong></p></td>
                                <td><p>: $contractNo</p></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><p><strong>Tempoh Kontrak </strong></p></td>
                                <td><p>: $effDate sehingga $expDate</p></td>
                            </tr>
							<tr>
                                <td><p><strong>Tarikh Penamatan Bersama </strong></p></td>
                                <td><p>: $decisionDate</p></td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
	<hr/>
    <div style="text-align: left;">
        <span style="font-weight: normal;">Dengan hormatnya saya merujuk kepada perkara di atas dan perbincangan bertarikh <strong>$decisionDate</strong> di antara Kerajaan dan syarikat tuan adalah berkaitan. </span>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: left;">
        <span style="font-weight: normal;">
            2. Berdasarkan perbincangan tersebut di atas, kontrak <strong>$contractTitle</strong> 
			ini akan ditamatkan atas persetujuan bersama berkuat kuasa mulai tarikh Perjanjian Penamatan Bersama ditandatangani. 
			Sehubungan itu, dipohon kerjasama syarikat tuan untuk mengambil tindakan berdasarkan klausa penamatan bersama dalam kontrak tersebut. 
        </span>
    </div>
    <div class="Section1">
        <div class="pageBreak">
            <table id="hrdftrtbl" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <div style="mso-element:header" id="h1"></div>
                        <div style="mso-element:footer" id="f1"></div>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            <br/>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div><br/></div>
    <br/>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: left;">Sekian, terima kasih.</div>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: left;">
        <br/>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; font-weight: normal;">
        <strong>"BERKHIDMAT UNTUK NEGARA"</strong>
    </div>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: left;">
        <br/>
    </div>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: left;">Saya yang menjalankan amanah,&nbsp;</div>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: left;">
        <br/>
    </div>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: left;">
        <br/>
    </div>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: left;">------------------------------------------------------</div>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: left;">
        <strong>$approverName</strong>
    </div>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: left;">
        <strong>$approverDesignation</strong>
    </div>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: left;">
        <strong>$ptjName</strong>
    </div>
    <div style="font-weight: normal; text-align: left;">
        <strong>$ministryName</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="Section2">
        <!-- Header and Footer Table -->
        <div class="pageBreak2">
            <table id="tblforheader" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <div style="mso-element:header" id="fh1">
                           <table>
                                <tbody>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><p><strong>Notis Kemungkiran Bagi </strong></p></td>
                                        <td><p><strong>:</strong></p></td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><p><strong>Kontrak </strong></p></td>
                                        <td><p>: $contractTitle</p></td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><p><strong>No. Kontrak </strong></p></td>
                                        <td><p>: $contractNo</p></td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><p><strong>Tempoh Kontrak </strong></p></td>
                                        <td><p>: $effDate sehingga $expDate</p></td>
                                    </tr>
                                    <tr>
                                        <td><p><strong>Rujukan </strong></p></td>
                                        <td><p>: $fileRefNo</p></td>
                                    </tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
							<hr/>
                        </div>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
